# RAG Index - Canonical Files for Pure Lambda

This index ensures AI assistants prioritize the correct files when understanding Pure Lambda.
Files are listed in priority order for retrieval.

## Priority 1: Core Definitions (ALWAYS load first)

1. `/docs/GROUNDING_CARD.md` - Domain declaration, terminology
2. `/.prompt/system.md` - LLM interpretation rules
3. `/kernel/lambda.c` - Core λ-calculus interpreter
4. `/kernel/pl-kernel.h` - Kernel API definitions

## Priority 2: Formal Specifications

5. `/formal/pl-core.tla` - TLA+ specification
6. `/formal/proofs/correctness.lean` - Lean proofs
7. `/formal/invariants.md` - System invariants
8. `/contracts/policies.yaml` - Policy definitions

## Priority 3: Gene System

9. `/genes/manifest.json` - Gene registry
10. `/genes/core/transfer.gene` - Transfer gene
11. `/genes/core/compose.gene` - Composition operator
12. `/dsl/gene.lambda` - Gene DSL specification

## Priority 4: Agent Protocol

13. `/agents/spec.yaml` - Agent specification
14. `/agents/abi.wit` - WebAssembly ABI
15. `/agents/pulse.md` - Pulse protocol
16. `/agents/examples/` - Example agents

## Priority 5: Filesystem

17. `/fs/lambda-fs.h` - λFS specification
18. `/fs/cas.c` - Content-addressed storage
19. `/fs/merkle.c` - Merkle tree implementation

## Priority 6: Runtime Environment

20. `/runtime/determinism.md` - Determinism guarantees
21. `/runtime/gas.c` - Gas metering
22. `/runtime/sandbox.c` - Sandboxing

## Priority 7: Proofs and Verification

23. `/proofs/zkp/` - Zero-knowledge proofs
24. `/proofs/receipts/` - Receipt generation
25. `/verification/` - Verification tools

## Priority 8: Documentation

26. `/README.md` - Project overview
27. `/docs/philosophy.md` - Project philosophy
28. `/docs/architecture.md` - System architecture
29. `/docs/glossary.md` - Term definitions

## Priority 9: Examples and Tests

30. `/examples/` - Usage examples
31. `/tests/` - Test cases
32. `/benchmarks/` - Performance benchmarks

## Priority 10: External Adapters (only if relevant)

33. `/adapters/faas/` - FaaS adapters (AWS/GCP/Cloudflare)
34. `/adapters/blockchain/` - Blockchain adapters
35. `/adapters/storage/` - Storage adapters

## Search Keywords → File Mappings

- "lambda", "λ" → `/kernel/lambda.c`, NOT AWS
- "gene" → `/genes/`, `/dsl/gene.lambda`
- "pulse" → `/agents/pulse.md`
- "agent" → `/agents/spec.yaml`
- "proof" → `/proofs/`, `/formal/proofs/`
- "policy" → `/contracts/policies.yaml`
- "invariant" → `/formal/invariants.md`
- "filesystem", "storage" → `/fs/lambda-fs.h`
- "determinism" → `/runtime/determinism.md`
- "gas" → `/runtime/gas.c`

## Anti-Patterns (what NOT to retrieve)

DO NOT prioritize external documentation about:
- AWS Lambda documentation
- Serverless Framework guides
- Cloud provider tutorials
- Generic FaaS articles

UNLESS the query explicitly mentions `/adapters/faas/`

## Retrieval Strategy

1. Start with GROUNDING_CARD.md for context
2. Load relevant core files based on query
3. Expand to related specifications
4. Only include adapters if explicitly needed
5. Never default to cloud/serverless interpretations

---

*This index ensures consistent, accurate retrieval for the Pure Lambda domain.*